 How to register
 ===============

 The price of a registration is 25 DM  or  25  USD.  If  you  want  to
 register,  please  print  out  the  form  below  and  mail  it to the
 following address:

 Juergen A.Lamers
 Altstr. 112
 D-52066 Aix la Chapelle
 Germany

 You can also mail the form to one of the following adresses:

  E-mail: jaloma@wuivendriet.fido.de
 FidoNet: Juergen A.Lamers at 2:2452/121

 If you for some reason can't print out the form or  send  it  to  me,
 send  me a letter with all information that you would have written on
 the form.

 You will receive your keyfile as soon as possible. If you have chosen
 to  have  the  keyfile  crashed or e-mailed to you, you will have the
 keyfile only a few days after I have receiced the money. If you  have
 chosen  to have the keyfile mailed to you on a disk, the time it will
 take for it to reach you depends on where you live.  Please  remember
 that  I  am  only  human and may be on vacation or extremely busy, in
 such cases it may take longer for you to get your keyfile.

 Please also remember this:
 ---------------------------------------------------------------------
 You pay for the current version of TAFileTagger, not for any updates.
 I   reserve  the  right,  not  do  develop  any  future  versions  of
 TAFileTagger. Any future updates will of course be free.
 ---------------------------------------------------------------------

